// Islamic world preset -- Modern Muslim Traveler.
//
// Single source of truth for the built-in "islamic" world.  This file is a
// faithful translation of the former src/seed_data_islamic.c and is compiled
// in at build time by tools/gen_world.c (which validates it and emits the
// generated carmen_world_build_islamic()).  Values are i18n keys, never
// display text; targets are resolved at case generation, not here.
//
// Clue design: clues are not baked onto sites.  Each city owns an inbound
// clue pool -- targetless descriptor keys that "point to it".  At case
// generation the engine builds a 3-regular flight graph, then draws
// positives from the next trail city's pool and red herrings from the two
// decoy neighbors' pools, assigning target_city_id at runtime (see src/case.c).
// Connections are not listed here: carmen_world_generate_connections()
// produces a fresh flight graph per case.
//
// "sphere" tags a city with its internal cultural sub-sphere grouping id
// (see doc/future/cross-sphere-connectivity.md); it is seed-only metadata,
// not display text.  Sites are investigation locations only and carry no
// clues.  City order defines storage[] slots, so it is preserved 1:1.
